{"chunk_id": "73e24aeb44b7", "area": "knowledge_area", "context_heading": "建材产业介绍", "date_hint": "", "text": "建材是建筑工程中使用的材料的统称，是基建产业链的上游。包括：木材、石材、水泥、混凝土、金属、砖瓦、陶瓷、玻璃、工程塑料、复合材料、各种涂料、油漆、镀层、贴面、各色瓷砖、防水材料、防火材料等。我国是基建大国，对于建材的需求一直很旺盛。随着碳中和的背景之下，我国建筑材料行业要在2025年前全面实现碳达峰，水泥等行业要在2023年前率先实现碳达峰。", "image_only": false, "classification": {"chunk_id": "73e24aeb44b7", "label": "candidate_mixed", "confidence": 0.5, "ontology_value": "low", "reason": "fallback: missing from LLM response", "is_fallback": true}, "final_bucket": "dropped_to_noise", "used_fallback": true, "judge_decision": "drop", "judge_confidence": 0.5, "judge_reason": "fallback: missing from judge response"}
{"chunk_id": "a911601bc795", "area": "knowledge_area", "context_heading": "建材产业介绍", "date_hint": "", "text": "1.1 建材行业属于中游行业\n建材行业属于中游行业，上游主要有石灰石、金属、石油化工类原料等，燃料动力主要有煤、石油焦、天然气等，下游主要面向地产开发商、单体建筑项目（含基建）以及消费者，部分对单体项目和消费者的销售要通过经销商。", "image_only": false, "classification": {"chunk_id": "a911601bc795", "label": "candidate_mixed", "confidence": 0.5, "ontology_value": "low", "reason": "fallback: missing from LLM response", "is_fallback": true}, "final_bucket": "dropped_to_noise", "used_fallback": true, "judge_decision": "drop", "judge_confidence": 0.5, "judge_reason": "fallback: missing from judge response"}
{"chunk_id": "448a28fb7ffe", "area": "knowledge_area", "context_heading": "建材产业介绍", "date_hint": "", "text": "1.2 运输半径如何影响建材行业竞争格局\n长期来看，随着运输成本降低以及运输环节的环保和载重安全标准提高，大企业的运输半径将逐步扩大，布点优势有望显现。同时，近年大企业也开始发力于品牌营销、渠道搭建和管理细化等方面，有利于在未来提高市占率，形成品牌溢价。因此，在运输便捷化趋势下，预计我国地域性品牌的品牌力会减弱，全国性品牌的品牌力会增强。", "image_only": false, "classification": {"chunk_id": "448a28fb7ffe", "label": "candidate_mixed", "confidence": 0.5, "ontology_value": "low", "reason": "fallback: missing from LLM response", "is_fallback": true}, "final_bucket": "dropped_to_noise", "used_fallback": true, "judge_decision": "drop", "judge_confidence": 0.5, "judge_reason": "fallback: missing from judge response"}
{"chunk_id": "ffc522cb9653", "area": "knowledge_area", "context_heading": "基建链条相关受益建材", "date_hint": "", "text": "", "image_only": true, "classification": {"label": "strict_knowledge", "confidence": 0.5, "ontology_value": "low", "reason": "image_only", "is_fallback": true}, "final_bucket": "strict_knowledge", "used_fallback": true}
{"chunk_id": "044c46af17fe", "area": "knowledge_area", "context_heading": "基建链条相关受益建材", "date_hint": "", "text": "基建链条中的建材子板块主要有水泥、防水、管道等。但从2022年上半年水泥产量增速来看，基建投资的带动效应不佳，主要原因或为：1）水泥下游需求约1/3来自地产，1/3来自基建，基建拉动效果有限；2）“基建政策发力-立项-债券发行融资-配套资金到位-加快支出形成实物工作量”之间存在时滞，而对建材需求的拉动需落实到实物工作量上。对于基建稳增长，在疫情冲击、国内经济下行压力下市场具备较充分的预期，2022年下半年重点仍在于基建链建材基本面的兑现。", "image_only": false, "classification": {"chunk_id": "044c46af17fe", "label": "candidate_mixed", "confidence": 0.5, "ontology_value": "low", "reason": "fallback: missing from LLM response", "is_fallback": true}, "final_bucket": "dropped_to_noise", "used_fallback": true, "judge_decision": "drop", "judge_confidence": 0.5, "judge_reason": "fallback: missing from judge response"}
